= Cooking
== What
== Why
== Way
- *bake:* cook bread and cakes in an oven without liquid
- *roast:* cook meat in an oven without liquid, cook potatoes in an oven in some fat 
- *grill:* cook meat and vegetables under or over strong heat
- *toast:* cook slices of bread under or over strong heat
- *broil:* American English of grill
- *boil:* cook something in boiling water
- *fry:* cook something in hot fat or oil
